   "line": [
    "Bb5"
   ],
   "spoken": "The Ruy Lopez — the bishop to b5, pinning the defender of e5.",
   "kind": "main"
  },
  {
   "ply": 7,
   "t": 22.5,
   "fen": "r1bqkbnr/1ppp1ppp/p1n5/4p3/B3P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 1 4",
   "line": [
    "a6",
    "Ba4"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 8,
   "t": 24.5,
   "fen": "r1bqkbnr/2pp1ppp/p1n5/1p2p3/B3P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 0 5",
   "line": [
    "b5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Black grabs space with b5. It's the Norwegian idea, and it's inaccurate — it sends the bishop where it wanted to go anyway while Black is still undeveloped.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "...b5 loses time when Black is behind"
   ]
  },
  {
   "ply": 10,
   "t": 37.5,
   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/2pp1ppp/p1n2n2/1p2p3/4P3/1B3N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 2 6",
   "line": [
    "Bb3",
    "Nf6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The bishop retreats to b3 — its ideal square — and Black's pieces are still at home.",
   "kind": "main"
  },
  {
   "ply": 11,
   "t": 67,
   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/2pp1ppp/p1n2n2/1p2p3/3PP3/1B3N2/PPP2PPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 0 6",
   "line": [
    "d4"
   ],
   "spoken": "The rule when your opponent is underdeveloped: open the center as fast as possible. So we strike with d4 to shred it open.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "open the center against a lagging opponent"
   ]
  },
  {
   "ply": 12,
   "t": 88.5,
   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/2p2ppp/p1np1n2/1p2p3/3PP3/1B3N2/PPP2PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 0 7",
   "line": [
    "d6"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 13,
   "t": 164,
   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/2p2ppp/p1np1n2/1p2p1N1/3PP3/1B6/PPP2PPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 1 7",
   "line": [
    "Ng5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Now the knight to g5 is strong — with the center tense it still targets f7, and a defensive d5 plunges Black into a lost race to castle. This is the revisit-the-move method: a move that didn't work a moment ago can be exactly right once the circumstances change.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "revisit a move when the position shifts"
   ]
  },
  {
   "ply": 10,
   "t": 213,
   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/2pp1ppp/p1n2n2/1p2p3/4P3/1B3N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 2 6",
   "line": [],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
